B.bsM=new A.F("0.12.0","Tezene oklar\u0131: notan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcnde \u2193 a\u015fa\u011f\u0131, \u2191 yukar\u0131 vuru\u015f. Foto\u011fraftaki oklar okunur; D\xfczenle\u2019de her notan\u0131n tezenesini se\xe7ebilirsin. Sat\u0131rlar as\u0131l gibiyken porte ekrana s\u0131\u011facak kadar k\xfc\xe7\xfcl\xfcr.")
B.bs6=new A.F("0.11.1","Haz\u0131r notada makam\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirince notalar da yeni donan\u0131ma uyabilir (\xf6r. foto\u011fraftan Si\u266d okunan Si\u266d2\u2019ler tek seferde). Sat\u0131r ba\u015f\u0131nda okunamayan donan\u0131m d\xfczeltildi.")
B.bt3=new A.F("0.11.0","D\xfczenle\u2019de s\xfcre: notay\u0131 onalt\u0131l\u0131k, sekizlik, d\xf6rtl\xfck, ikilik\u2026 yap. Haz\u0131r notada sat\u0131rlar as\u0131ldaki gibi kal\u0131r, uzun notalar ba\u011fla yaz\u0131l\u0131r, birlikte vurulan teller (akor) foto\u011fraftan daha iyi okunur.")
B.brx=new A.F("0.10.0","Haz\u0131r Nota Y\xfckle: nota adlar\u0131n\u0131 yaz, MuseScore/MusicXML ya da MIDI dosyas\u0131 a\xe7, ya da nota foto\u011fraf\u0131/PDF y\xfckle; sonra D\xfczenle ile d\xfczelt.")
B.bsQ=new A.F("0.9.1","Bir notaya dokununca ad\u0131 \xe7\u0131kar ve sadece o notan\u0131n saz sesi \xe7alar (\u015fark\u0131n\u0131n tamam\u0131 \xe7almaz). D\xfczenle penceresinde se\xe7ti\u011fin yeni notay\u0131 da duyars\u0131n.")
