B.brK=new A.F("Sat\u0131rlar ve ba\u011flar","Y\xfcklenen notada ka\xe7 sat\u0131r varsa uygulama da ayn\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir (\u201cSat\u0131rlar as\u0131l gibi\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesi; kapat\u0131rsan sat\u0131rlar ekrana s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r). \xd6l\xe7\xfcye s\u0131\u011fmayan uzun notalar ba\u011fla yaz\u0131l\u0131r. Birlikte vurulan teller (\xf6r. La-La-Mi karar sesi) \xfcst \xfcste akor olarak yaz\u0131l\u0131r.")
B.br9=new A.F("Tezene oklar\u0131","K\xe2\u011f\u0131ttaki notan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcndeki \u2193 \u2191 oklar foto\u011fraftan okunur ve ayn\u0131 yerde g\xf6sterilir (\u201cTezene oklar\u0131\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesi). D\xfczenle\u2019de bir notaya dokunup \u201cTezene: \u2193 A\u015fa\u011f\u0131 / \u2191 Yukar\u0131 / Yok\u201d ile de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsin. MusicXML\u2019e aktar\u0131nca da yaz\u0131l\u0131r.")
B.brf=new A.F("Kay\u0131t yok","Haz\u0131r notada ses kayd\u0131 olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in kay\u0131t \xe7alma, A-B ve Akorlu (YZ) yoktur. Tempo sadece \u201cYaz\u0131lan\u0131 sazla \xe7al\u201d h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirir.")
